{{Life in Balisca}}
The following is a [[W:Cost-of-living index|price index]] reporting the average costs of goods and services in [[Balisca]] that is compiled by the [[Instituto Confederal de Stadística]] (ICS), as part of the confederal pursuit of an [[W:right to an adequate standard of living|adequate standard of living]] and the [[W:Right to rest and leisure|right to rest and leisure]] in Balisca's [[W:Post-growth|post-growth]] experiment. This chart represents the average costs across the twenty-five [[List of cities in Balisca by population|largest cities in Balisca]] in December 2023.

==Chart==

Maximum and minimum refers to the cities with the highest and lowest average cost. All values are in [[International dollars]] (I$) unless otherwise stated.

